---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Events
permalink: /events/
description: "The FRIENDS of SIES annual calendar: Directory & Signs, the Soar on Skimmers Fun Run, Give to Grow, and the Spring Auction."
---
<header class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <h1>Events &amp; the Annual Calendar</h1>
    <p class="lede">FRIENDS runs on four moments across the school year — from fall sponsorships to the spring auction, with our year-round Give to Grow campaign always open.</p>
  </div>
  {% include "partials/wave-sand.njk" %}
</header>

{% for event in events.events %}
<section class="event{% if event.slug == 'fun-run' %} event-has-media{% endif %}{% if event.slug == 'give-to-grow' %} card-has-img{% endif %}" id="{{ event.slug }}" aria-labelledby="{{ event.slug }}-h">
  <div class="event-body">
    <h2 id="{{ event.slug }}-h">{{ event.name }}</h2>
    <p class="event-season">{{ event.season }}</p>
    <p>{{ event.summary }}</p>
    <p><strong>How to take part:</strong> {{ event.participate }}</p>
    {% if event.link == "TODO" %}
    <p class="todo-placeholder"><strong>{{ event.linkLabel }}</strong></p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% if event.slug == 'give-to-grow' %}
  <img class="card-img" src="/assets/images/garden-harvest.jpg" alt="Students show off radishes harvested from the school garden" loading="lazy">
  {% endif %}
  {% if event.slug == 'fun-run' %}
  <div class="event-media">
    <img class="event-logo" src="/assets/images/soar-on-skimmers.jpg" alt="Soar on Skimmers Fun Run artwork — a black skimmer bird gliding over a wave under a sunburst" loading="lazy">
    <img class="event-photo" src="/assets/images/fun-run-beach.jpg" alt="Students run along the beach during the Soar on Skimmers Fun Run" loading="lazy">
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>
{% endfor %}

<section class="card" aria-labelledby="auction-history">
  <h2 id="auction-history">About the auction's tradition</h2>
  <p>The spring auction has been an island tradition for years — known historically as "Auction by the Sea" and more recently themed around "The Rock." The theme evolves each year; the community spirit doesn't. Details and the 2027 date will be announced.</p>
</section>

<section class="band band-sea closing-cta">
  <svg class="band-wave" viewBox="0 0 1440 70" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M0,45 C240,15 480,60 720,35 C960,10 1200,55 1440,30 L1440,0 L0,0 Z" fill="#fdfaf5"></path></svg>
  <div class="band-inner">
    <h2 class="section-title">Take part this year</h2>
    <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/ways-to-give/">Give to Grow — Donate</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
